        {
          "re": "\\b(would you like me to|do you want me to|shall i|let me know if you'?d like me to|i can also)\\b[^.?!\\n]{0,50}\\b(format|expand|elaborate|provide|prepare|turn (this|it) into|go deeper|put together|summari[sz]e|draft)\\b",
          "sev": "HIGH",
          "fix": "the leftover assistant turn: stop, or name one real next step"
        },
        {
          "re": "\\b(here'?s|this is) the (part|thing) (nobody|no one) (talks|tells you) about\\b|\\bhere'?s the kicker\\b|\\bthe best part\\?|\\bthe (real|honest) answer\\b|\\blet me be direct\\b|\\bworth stating plainly\\b",
          "sev": "HIGH",
          "fix": "announced payoff: deliver it without the drumroll"
